Package: childe
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: x11-xserver-utils
Description: Utility to open next workspace
 An wm utility intended to be called by keybinding
 to open next available empty workspace.
 .
 With --workspace-names it keeps running and keeps every
 workspace's name showing the apps on it, in sway and i3.
 In i3 it reads its resources with xrdb, from
 x11-xserver-utils.
